    {
      "id": "claim_67092fdb4d0c443cad20fc830baff4d1",
      "statement": "The read path is GET /key/*key-path -> Handler.ReadKeyOrSubkeyHandler -> SecureKeyUseCase.Read, which maps port.ErrKeyNotFound to 404 and any other error (including Vault decrypt failures) to 500 while returning value, custom_metadata, version, and created_time.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://internal/adapters/driving/rest/handler.go#L283-L329",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:46430e0cad0ee71695db9e3ca44beb4cdb70c0ac2bf6323113ae218300f1a80e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://internal/domain/usecase/secure_key_usecase.go#L143-L218",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:69a99f399ed9b78aa0787d98614020798b2ba118caaaaa0a9bd0cd94073ce0fc:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_cad77984ce85457fb5ff6ca6456e886b",
      "statement": "secureKeyUseCase.Read derives the cache key as path + \"::\" + key and, on a cache hit with a successful type assertion to the internal cachedKey struct, returns the cached plaintext and KeyData without any storage query or Vault call; cache errors and failed type assertions degrade to a miss.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://internal/domain/usecase/secure_key_usecase.go#L143-L162",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:dc8cbb926c2a8d521f03aced9371f1c6d1fce05d119a9b84c561e8006e789670:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1b2e5965b7e6428697fcec6e91b26b26",
      "statement": "On a cache miss, Read joins sfGroup.Do keyed by the same path::key string, so concurrent misses for one key collapse into a single execution that performs storage.Find then encryptor.Decrypt once for all waiters.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://internal/domain/usecase/secure_key_usecase.go#L164-L198",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0d6256ee7c0942c05150467a6386bac96f45bd9d7e7589c901bfa7840a3f2649:"
        },
        {
